 Messages exist in English (`en`) and Korean (`ko`), in
-`src/i18n/messages.js`. The server answers in `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
+`src/i18n/messages.js`. The server uses the highest-weighted supported language in
+`Accept-Language`, taking the first on a tie. Regional tags such as `ko-KR`
+match their primary language. If no supported language has a positive weight,
+the server uses `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
